I&#x27;m <strong>Narayani Garg</strong>, MBA &amp; practitioner of Vedic Astrology, Numerology, Vastu &amp; Subconscious Alignment.</p><p class="intro-bio-text">I&#x27;ve helped <strong>1,200+ individuals</strong> break repeating cycles in career, marriage and health by looking at the one thing traditional remedies overlook: <em>the receptive state of your mind.</em></p><div class="intro-stats-card"><div class="stats-card-header"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect><path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path><line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line></svg><span>Join our community across 4 countries</span></div><div class="stats-card-grid"><div class="stats-item"><strong class="stats-number">1,200+</strong><span class="stats-label">Guided</span></div><div class="stats-item"><strong class="stats-number">8+</strong><span class="stats-label">Years Practice</span></div><div class="stats-item"><strong class="stats-number">100%</strong><span class="stats-label">Confidential</span></div></div></div><a href="https://wa.me/919205511101?text=Hello%20Narayani%20Garg%20team,%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20a%20free%20consultation." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="intro-cta-button" data-enquiry="true" data-topic="Free Consultation"><svg class="whatsapp-btn-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.04 2c-5.46 0-9.91 4.45-9.91 9.91 0 1.75.46 3.45 1.32 4.95L2.05 22l5.25-1.38c1.45.79 3.08 1.21 4.74 1.21 5.46 0 9.91-4.45 9.91-9.91 0-2.65-1.03-5.14-2.9-7.01A9.816 9.816 0 0 0 12.04 2z"></path></svg><span>Book a Free Consultation / Enquire</span><span class="intro-cta-arrow">↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class="band has-backdrop" aria-labelledby="story-title"><svg class="backdrop backdrop-kundli in-story" viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="20" y="20" width="260" height="260" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1"></rect><path d="M20 20L280 280M280 20L20 280M150 20L280 150L150 280L20 150Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" stroke-width="1"></path></svg><div class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="story-title">How she came to this work</h2></div><div class="story-grid"><figure class="portrait-frame story-portrait"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcSet="/images/narayani-portrait-480.avif 480w, /images/narayani-portrait-684.avif 684w" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 58vw, 22vw"/><source type="image/webp" srcSet="/images/narayani-portrait-480.webp 480w, /images/narayani-portrait-684.webp 684w" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 58vw, 22vw"/><img src="/images/narayani-portrait-gold.png" alt="Narayani Garg - The Life Strategist" width="684" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></picture></figure><ol class="story"><li><span class="story-step">Business first</span><h3>An MBA, then a decade running a manufacturing business.</h3><p>People, numbers and decisions, before the practice.</p></li><li><span class="story-step">The practice</span><h3>Numerology, vastu and astrology, with the mind first.</h3><p>Consultations by word of mouth: more than 10,000 clients, in India and abroad.</p></li><li><span class="story-step">The book</span><h3>A 21-day practice for inner change, set down in her book.</h3><p>The mind and its habits, energy and the chakras, and the four areas of life, one practice a day.</p></li><li><span class="story-step">Today</span><h3>Transformation with NNG.</h3><p>Her consultations, and since August 2026 her channel on YouTube and Instagram.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section class="band" aria-labelledby="beliefs-title"><div class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="beliefs-title">What she holds to</h2></div><div class="beliefs"><div class="belief"><h3>The mind comes first.</h3><p>“No remedy works when the mindset is not right.” Her words, and where every consultation begins.</p></div><div class="belief"><h3>No fear, ever.</h3><p>“I have never sold fear to anyone.” She explains her guidance so you can decide what feels right for you.</p></div><div class="belief"><h3>One life, four areas.</h3><p>Health, relationship, career and money, looked at together, because they move together.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="section-wrap section-space book-feature" aria-labelledby="book-title"><div class="book-cover-stage book-cover"><div class="book-cover-inner"><img src="/images/book-cover-660.webp" srcSet="/images/book-cover-440.webp 440w, /images/book-cover-660.webp 660w" sizes="(max-width: 680px) 75vw, 420px" width="660" height="934" alt="The cover of Change Your Mind, Transform Your Life, by Narayani Garg" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div><div><h2 id="book-title"><em>Change Your Mind, Transform Your Life</em></h2><p>Her 21-day guide to inner change: the mind and its habits, energy and the chakras, the four areas of life, a practice for each day.</p><div class="method-quote"><p>“When you change your mind, you change your world.”</p><span>From the book</span></div></div></section><section class="band" aria-labelledby="voices-title"><div class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="section-heading centered"><h2 id="voices-title">From London to the exam hall</h2><p>Shelley, after seven years. Vanshika, before her Grade 10 exams, and her mother with her.</p></div><div class="testimonial-grid" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Client testimonials"><article class="testimonial"><span class="testimonial-tag">London, about seven years</span><blockquote><p>“<!-- -->She helped me and guided me through it. It has helped me with my business and my personal life, and changed me from always thinking negative into thinking more positive.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><footer class="client"><div>Shelley</div></footer><button type="button" class="voice-preview"><img src="/images/testimonials/client-4.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="voice-preview-shade" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="voice-preview-copy"><span class="voice-preview-hook">I was all over the place</span><span class="voice-preview-action"><span class="thumbnail-play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Watch their story <span>1:20</span></span></span><span class="visually-hidden">: <!-- -->Shelley</span></button></article><article class="testimonial"><span class="testimonial-tag">Grade 10 student</span><blockquote><p>“<!-- -->I used to be very anxious, even for my class tests. She never sugar-coated anything, which really helped me prepare for my exams. Thank you for transforming my anxiety into confidence.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><footer class="client"><div>Vanshika S.</div></footer><button type="button" class="voice-preview"><img src="/images/testimonials/client-5.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="voice-preview-shade" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="voice-preview-copy"><span class="voice-preview-hook">From exam fear to confidence</span><span class="voice-preview-action"><span class="thumbnail-play" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> Watch their story <span>0:43</span></span></span><span class="visually-hidden">: <!-- -->Vanshika S.</span></button></article><article class="testimonial"><span class="testimonial-tag">A mother</span><blockquote><p>“<!-- -->I joined for my daughter. Now she is well, and she is happy.<!-- -->”</p></blockquote><footer class="client"><div>Shashi S.<small>Translated from Hindi</small></div></footer><button type="button" class="voice-preview"><img src="/images/testimonials/client-6.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><span class="voice-preview-shade" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="voice-preview-copy"><span class="voice-preview-hook">I came for my daughter</span><span c